  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORCAP Experts Jordan Ministry of Education System Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment of up to five NORCAP experts to the Jordan Ministry of Education through UNESCO&apos;s System Strengthening Partnership (SSP). The SSP is a multi-donor fund supported by Canada, Switzerland, Italy and Norway. 

The project&#x2019;s main objective is to strengthen and develop education planning and programming capacity within the MoE, with the overall aim of ensuring that Jordan has a well-functioning and well-monitored national education system, leading to equitable and inclusive access to quality education, as well as improved learning outcomes for all children and youth in Jordan, aligned with the UN Sustainable Development Goal on education (SDG4).

Expert Positions: 
&#x2022;	Monitoring and Evaluation Coordination Officer  
&#x2022;	Senior Data Analyst and Statistician Officer 
&#x2022;	Partnership and Coordination Officer 
&#x2022;	Senior Gender in Education Expert 
&#x2022;	Crisis and Risk Management in Education Expert (new position - to start summer 2023)</narrative>
  </description>
